37. In section 53 of the principal Act,— Amendment
of section 53.
(i) for the words "benefit sharing", the words "fair and equitable sharing of
benefits" shall be substituted;
(ii) after the words "order made by the High Court", the words "or the National
Green Tribunal" shall be inserted;
(iii) after the words "Registrar of the High Court", the words "or the Registrar of
the National Green Tribunal" shall be inserted;
(iv) in the Explanation, after the words "group of persons", wherever they
occur, the words "or body" shall be substituted.
